eginRevision(r1) → Control Inbox / raw refs + prior" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="358" y="390.0" width="1344" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note6" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D2  Joint Work Queue → JointJob(j1,r1) / loop는 복귀" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="998" y="472.3529411764706" width="1176" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note7" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D3  R.readAsync(scope,lease) / 원본 owner에 bounded 조회" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="554.7058823529412" width="1224" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note8" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D4  immutable receipt / O17,P3 + coverage + sourceVector" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="637.0588235294117" width="1344" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note9" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D5  M.invokeAsync(j1): raw + “두 graph” + prior" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="719.4117647058824" width="1104" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D6  j1 done: 직접 생산한 두 extent와 b3 delta" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowra