tColor=#B63732;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="358" y="1213.5294117647059" width="1440" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note16" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D12  Joint Work Queue: j2 / 정정 + prior + 유효 raw refs" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="998" y="1295.8823529411766" width="1248" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note17" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D13  M.invokeAsync(j2): 아래 graph만 / 부분 재판단" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="1378.235294117647" width="1008" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note18" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D14  j1b late done: gate에서 r1 불일치 → 상태 갱신 없음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#B63732;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="1460.5882352941178" width="1056" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note19" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D15  j2 done: KEEP b1,b2 / REPLACE b3 → lower extent" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="1542.9411764705883" width="1248" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note20" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D16  RevisionGate → TryApply(r2,base,delta) → unlock" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="1625.294117647059" width="1248" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note21" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D17  Completion Inbox: Ready(j2) / raw deps + binding version" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="998" y="1707.6470588235295" width="1464" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note22" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D18  GroundingProposal r2 → 현재성 검사 후 State Store 채택" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="358" y="1790.0" width="1224" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note23" parent="1" vertex="1" value="A: 새 lower extent와 keep/replace 의미를 같은 해석 책임이 직접 생산한다. crop/cache/부분 patch를 허용한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=26;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1884" width="2106" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note24" parent="1" vertex="1" value="공통: 결과 대기 중 capture / 전사 / local stop은 계속된다. Request Controller가 최신 revision, 사용권, 근거와 base version을 검사한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1941" width="2544" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note25" parent="1" vertex="1" value="채택 뒤에는 전체 요청 해석과 admission을 거쳐 응답 / 업무로 연결한다. 일부 지칭 실패는 해당 범위를 질문하며 앞의 의미를 임의 확정하지 않는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1991" width="2088" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note26" parent="1" vertex="1" value="R/M = 구조도의 같은 read/model adapter / gate 안에는 await 없음 / B의 각 worker 내부 R/M 왕복은 축약 / 실행 trace와 성능 측정 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#758294;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="2042" width="2323" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note27" parent="1" vertex="1" value="실선: 요청 / 파랑 점선: 결과 / 빨강 점선: 정정과 무효화 / 회색 점선: 상태 게시 / 실행 trace가 아닌 같은 사건의 설계 예시" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#758294;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="2097" width="1794" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
